  "prompt": "请为 Notebook source hunt C40 准备下一批 C 级祈福／祈祷仪式资料卡的联网来源搜寻。\n\n本轮是在 C39 来源清理已经应用之后，对 docs/notebook-validation.json 中全部 grade=C 卡片的「## 参考来源」重新计数；不得因为某卡曾出现在 C1–C39 的早期批次就排除它。仍含 britannica.com、encyclopedia.com 或 everyculture.com 的弱链接均须计入。当前 C 级卡片共 156 张，仍含弱链接的卡片共 67 张。\n\n选择规则：在全部仍含上述弱链接的 C 级卡片中，按弱链接数量从多到少排序；并列时按 slug 字母序排序；选择前 12 张。不要为了凑数选择无弱链接的卡片，也不要排除先前批次出现过的卡片。\n\n选择结果（按优先顺序）：\n1. abruzzese-folk（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 2 条）\n2. akha-traditional（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 5 条）\n3. aland-folk（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 4 条）\n4. andalusian-folk（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 4 条）\n5. andorran-folk（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 4 条）\n6. baul-bengal（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 5 条）\n7. bemba-traditional（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 5 条）\n8. bornholm-folk（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 5 条）\n9. buyei-traditional（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 5 条）\n10. calabrian-folk（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 4 条）\n11. chinese-buddhism（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 6 条）\n12. corsican-folk（弱链接 1 条；当前来源 4 条）\n\n逐卡当前来源（[WEAK] 表示待替换的弱链接）：\n\n### 1. abruzzese-folk — 阿布鲁佐民间天主教与朝圣祈福（Abruzzese）\n仪式：圣母／山村朝圣（概念层）；主保节巡游（概念层）；灾后纪念与公共祈祷（概念层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Roman-Catholicism\n- https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/celestinian-forgiveness-celebration-01276\n\n### 2. akha-traditional — 阿卡族传统信仰与秋千节祈福（Akha）\n仪式：秋千节公共层（节庆／观光可见）；祖先供奉与家屋礼仪焦点（敏感，仅概念）；村门、秋千架与礼仪权威（高度敏感，仅概念）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Akha\n- https://thesiamsociety.org/knowledge-hub/research/267?lang=en\n- https://www.tatnews.org/2025/08/akha-swing-festival-2025-celebrates-hill-tribe-traditions-in-chiang-rai/\n- https://doi.org/10.30819/aemr.2\n- https://ich.unesco.org/fr/une-experience-de-patrimoine-vivant-et-la-pandemie-de-covid-19-01124?id=00021\n\n### 3. aland-folk — 奥兰民间基督教与群岛祈福（Åland）\n仪式：路德宗礼拜与教会节期（概念层）；航海感恩与还愿（概念层）；仲夏等公共民俗层（概念层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Church-of-Sweden\n- https://visitaland.com/en/experience/sights-excursions/aland-churches/\n- https://visitaland.com/en/experience/midsummer-in-aland/\n- https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/utforska/hogtider/midsommar/\n\n### 4. andalusian-folk — 安达卢西亚民间天主教与罗马里亚朝圣祈福（Andalusian）\n仪式：圣周游行（概念层）；Romería 乡村朝圣（概念层）；弥撒与生命礼仪（概念层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Semana-Santa\n- https://guiadigital.iaph.es/bien/inmaterial/195121\n- https://repositorio.iaph.es/handle/11532/324987\n- https://www.juntadeandalucia.es/cultura/agendaculturaldeandalucia/evento/semana-santa-de-almonte\n\n### 5. andorran-folk — 安道尔民间天主教与山地朝圣祈福（Andorran）\n仪式：Meritxell 圣母敬礼（概念层）；堂区主保节（概念层）；山地还愿（概念层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Our-Lady-of-Meritxell\n- https://www.govern.ad/ca/tematiques/cultura-i-esports/patrimoni-cultural/que-es-el-patrimoni-immaterial/les-festes-d-interes-cultural/l-aplec-de-la-mare-de-deu-de-meritxell\n- https://museus.ad/en/monumentos/sanctuary-of-meritxell\n- https://www.govern.ad/ca/tematiques/cultura-i-esports/patrimoni-cultural/arxiu-d-etnografia-d-andorra/falles-d-andorra\n\n### 6. baul-bengal — 孟加拉鲍尔／行吟密契传统（Baul）\n仪式：行吟演唱与乐器伴奏（公共文化层）；以歌传道／口传哲学（概念层）；身体为神殿的密契取向（限制性公共知识层）\n当前来源：\n- https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/baul-songs-00107\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/art/Baul\n- https://www.unesco.org/archives/multimedia/document-612\n- https://ich.unesco.org/en/photo-pop-up-00973?photoID=00147\n- https://ich.unesco.org/en/projects/action-plan-for-the-safeguarding-of-baul-songs-00047\n\n### 7. bemba-traditional — 本巴传统宗教与莱萨—祖灵祈福（Bemba）\n仪式：旱灾等危机中的 Lesa 集体祈请（概念层）；祖灵与王室圣地敬礼（部分敏感）；教会生活与生命礼仪（公共／当代层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Bemba\n- https://doi.org/10.17159/2309-9585/2026/v52a7\n- https://doi.org/10.1093/acref/9780195301731.013.48534\n- https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fenvs.2025.1538921\n- https://repository.up.ac.za/server/api/core/bitstreams/644905d8-357e-4d23-b318-2c400436484a/content\n\n### 8. bornholm-folk — 博恩霍尔姆民间基督教与岛屿祈福（Bornholm）\n仪式：路德宗礼拜与教会节期（概念层）；航海感恩（概念层）；岁时公共民俗层（概念层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Church-of-Denmark\n- https://bornholm.info/en/oesterlars-round-church/\n- https://bornholm.info/en/round-churches-on-bornholm/\n- https://www.visitdenmark.com/denmark/destinations/bornholm/attractions\n- http://danmarkskirker.natmus.dk/\n\n### 9. buyei-traditional — 布依族传统信仰与三月三祈福（Buyei／Bouyei）\n仪式：三月三等岁时节庆（公共层）；祭祖与自然圣物敬礼（部分敏感）；扫寨／清洁寨落叙事（概念层，禁止操作）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Buyei\n- https://factsanddetails.com/china/cat5/sub30/entry-4379.html\n- https://doi.org/10.1163/2210-7363_ecll_COM_000055\n- https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2019.02603\n- https://doi.org/10.3389/fpls.2024.1364481\n\n### 10. calabrian-folk — 卡拉布里亚民间天主教与朝圣祈福（Calabrian）\n仪式：圣母朝圣与还愿（概念层）；主保节巡游（概念层）；圣周公共礼仪（概念层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Roman-Catholicism\n- https://calabriastraordinaria.it/en/news/jubilee-2025-in-the-dioceses-of-calabria-sites-paths-and-festivities\n- https://calabriastraordinaria.it/storage/files/02_L%27arte_e_la_Cultura_EN.pdf\n- https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/celebration-of-big-votive-structures-processions-00882\n\n### 11. chinese-buddhism — 汉传佛教\n仪式：放生（放生）；礼佛诵经与诸佛菩萨名号持念；大悲水加持与功德回向\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Buddhism/Popular-religious-practices\n- https://buddhiststudies.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Shiu_Stokes_2008_Animal-Release.pdf\n- https://doi.org/10.1515/cdc-2015-0008\n- https://doi.org/10.38144/TKT.2026.1.3\n- https://doi.org/10.3390/rel14010110\n- https://doi.org/10.1111/rec3.12483\n\n### 12. corsican-folk — 科西嘉民间天主教与朝圣祈福（Corsican）\n仪式：Catenacciu（Sartène）公共忏悔巡游（公开层）；主保节与 Paghjella 多声部歌唱（概念层）；Signatoru 民俗疗愈注记与生命礼仪（概念层）\n当前来源：\n- [WEAK] https://www.britannica.com/topic/Roman-Catholicism\n- https://ich.unesco.org/en/USL/cantu-in-paghjella-a-secular-and-liturgical-oral-tradition-of-corsica-00315\n- https://www.visit-corsica.com/en/Explore-Corsica/Our-inspirations/Cultural-inspirations/U-Catenacciu-in-Sartene-experience-the-Good-Friday-procession-in-the-heart-of-Corsica\n- https://www.isula.corsica/culture/agenda/Scola-di-cantu-Venachese-Cours-de-chant-Cantu-in-Paghjella-e-Cantu-sacru-Canti-cu-Ghitara-Mairie-Venacu_ae1957142.html\n\n对每个选中 slug 给出 2–4 条新的、公开可核验的 URL，并附一句中文说明覆盖